    "title": "Tennessee Tech tennis match against TSU rescheduled for noon on March 29",
    "text": "Tennessee Tech announced on March 25 that the Golden Eagles’ upcoming men’s tennis match against Tennessee State University has been rescheduled to begin at noon. The match, part of the Horizon League schedule, will take place at the Tech Tennis Courts in Cookeville.\nThe adjustment moves the start time one hour earlier than previously planned. Organizers said admission to the event will be free and open to the public.\nThis change aims to accommodate both teams and fans who plan to attend Sunday’s contest. Tennessee Tech encourages community members and students to come out and support their team.\nNo additional background or historical context was provided regarding this scheduling update.",
